From 964a31863335c0b5bc026e88c00295eff707c43c Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Randolph <randolph@andestech.com>
Date: Wed, 7 Aug 2024 19:50:05 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 11/53] swdtb: add dma coherent/non-coherent attribute (#104)

1. swdtb: dma: add dma-coherent/dma-noncoherent into dma node
2. swdtb: mac: add dma-coherent/dma-noncoherent into mac node
3. swdtb: mmc: add dma-coherent/dma-noncoherent into mmc node
4. swdtb: snd: add dma-coherent/dma-noncoherent into snd node
5. swdtb: lcd: add dma-coherent/dma-noncoherent into lcd node

*Add dma-coherent/dma-noncoherent into dma node:
Example: in coherent bit map
    dma@f0c00000 {
        dma-coherent;
    };

Example: in noncoherent bit map
    dma@f0c00000 {
        dma-noncoherent;
    };

*Add dma-coherent/dma-noncoherent into mac node:
Example: in coherent bit map
    mac@e0100000  {
        dma-coherent;
    };

Example: in noncoherent bit map
    mac@e0100000  {
        dma-noncoherent;
    };

*Add dma-coherent/dma-noncoherent into mmc node:
Example: in coherent bit map
    mmc@f0e00000  {
        dma-coherent;
    };

Example: in noncoherent bit map
    mmc@f0e00000  {
        dma-noncoherent;
    };

*Add dma-coherent/dma-noncoherent into snd node:
Example: in coherent bit map
    snd@f0d00000 {
        dma-coherent;
    };

Example: in noncoherent bit map
    snd@f0d00000 {
        dma-noncoherent;
    };

*Add dma-coherent/dma-noncoherent into lcd node
Example: in coherent bit map
    lcd@e0200000 {
        dma-coherent;
    };

Example: in noncoherent bit map
    lcd@e0200000 {
        dma-noncoherent;
    };

